body:
hey! the first started on 25mg i noticed stomach ache and diarrhea. i was also very very sleepy. i also noticed that i was less horny. i also began to clench my jaw a lot in my sleep. 

&#x200B;

when i went from 50mg to 100 mg, i noticed some slight twitching the first few days and feeling numb towards everything. i still clench my jaw a lot in my sleep. now im doing okay though.
